        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Tympanic Heartbeat"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, auditory)\n\n120 feet. Kothogaz's heartbeat booms like a deity's drum. A creature that enters or begins its turn in the emanation must attempt a 41 Will save. On a failure, its next two actions must be move actions to move at least half its Speed away from Kothogaz. A creature that critically succeeds is temporarily immune to tympanic heartbeat for 1 minute."
            },
            "id": "3dd0feaf-4b3a-4603-85c1-5b0837613b85",
